Read before editing. Keep changes small. Do not print secrets. Run the closest smoke test after changing code. Ask before destructive commands, deploys, or payment actions.

Role mapping: Cursor → Builder (heavy multi-file authoring, refactors, migrations).
Follow docs/THE-METHOD.md, docs/AGENT-SYNC-PROTOCOL.md, and docs/ROLES.md.
